  "details": "Once your friend count exceeds 2,000, it takes a very long time to load instances.\n\nI’ve been playing VRChat for nearly six years. I look forward to visiting various public instances every day.\n\nHowever, since my friend count increased, I’ve started experiencing a wait time of about 3 to 5 minutes every time I move to a new instance before it loads.\n\nI suspect that the system reloads the entire friend list every time the instance list is displayed, so I’d appreciate it if there were a better way to resolve this.\n\nAlternatively, I think a feature that allows users to bulk-manage friends they haven’t seen in years or have only met once could help prevent friend counts from growing excessive\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)",
